  "scope": "Restore exact current-agent view proofs for detail/capabilities/relationships/sessions via sealed additive Normal/Audit profile. Reuse unchanged canonical detail/capability/relationship functions; replace historical constant-empty Agent sessions with scoped real summaries attributed by same-scope projected agent events before keyset limit. Independent authorization on every child operation, parent/operation-bound signed cursors, current membership/fence checks, exact selected profile and startup/periodic readiness. Existing full session-content authorization retained. No automatic profile installation or activation.",
